<title>ITALY: Italy says it will make benchmark euro bond issue.</title>
<headline>Italy says it will make benchmark euro bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian Treasury said it plans to make a benchmark euro-bond issue in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>&quot;The Italian republic announces its intentions of issuing a five-year 'benchmark' in U.S. dollars on the euromarket,&quot; the treasury said in a statement. &quot;Morgan Stanley International and SBC Warburg will oversee the arranging of the operation.&quot;</p>
<p>The statement did not give the amount of the intended issue. --Rome bureau, +00396 678 2501</p>
</text>
